== Use of Artificial Intelligence

The team used three generative artificial intelligence tools during the event: Claude @claude, ChatGPT @chatgpt, and Google Antigravity @antigravity. They assisted with writing and reviewing code, debugging, designing the interface, preparing analysis scripts, and drafting and editing documentation, including this report. Team members reviewed, tested, and edited all AI-assisted output and take responsibility for the final content. All figures, tables, and numerical results were computed from the PyroTrace database and the test runner by code included in the repository; none were generated by an AI tool.

